---

Combine multiple PDFs in your browser — no upload, no account.

## Steps

1. Open the **Merge PDF** tool on WeLovePDF.
2. Select two or more PDF files, or drag them onto the drop zone.
3. Reorder files if needed — order determines page sequence.
4. Optionally enable blank pages between documents.
5. Click **Merge PDF** and download the combined file instantly.

## Tips

- Files never leave your device.
- Use the homepage drop zone to jump straight into Merge.
